=20
over, typed in the URL, and soon had their site up. I even sent an e-mail,=
=20
and I got a quick response. Kinda neat the way the Web makes the world=20
smaller. Here I was, watching TV in America about Icelanders at the South=
=20
Pole, and communicating directly with them (in Iceland) at the same time. I=
f=20
I'd been in the market for a SUV modified for arctic conditions, they'd hav=
e=20
probably made a sale. They take Toyota Land Cruisers (or other SUVs) and=20
modify them to cruise comfortably over ice and snow in the coldest weather=
=20
you can imagine. Rescue vehicles are a specialty. If you need one, here's t=
he=20
source!
