The procedure to connect an incoming call to " Voice Mail "

1)  If you pick up a call on someone's line, and the person calling request 
to be connected to Voice Mail:

      A)   Press the " T "  transfer  button.
      B)   Press * 99

     The caller is now connected to Voice mail.


2)  If a person calls on a line other than the employees  line and is 
requesting to be connected to their Voice Mail :

     A)   Press the " T " transfer button.
     B)   Dial 57001 and the employees extension number.
     C)   Press the release button.

