 -----Original Message-----
From: 	owner-pjm-emc@pjm.com@ENRON <mailto:owner-pjm-emc@pjm.com@ENRON>   On Behalf Of kenney@pjm.com <mailto:kenney@pjm.com>
Sent:	Friday, November 16, 2001 4:31 PM
To:	pjm-emc@risc1.pjm.com <mailto:pjm-emc@risc1.pjm.com>
Subject:	pjm-emc FW: PJM West Day Ahead Market Trials

The following message has been posted to the PJM Energy Market Committee
Mailing List (pjm-emc):


> ATTENTION:
>
> To participate in the PJM Day Ahead Market Trials, please login and submit bid
> and offer information to the following Market Trials web site
> <https://emrkt2.pjm.com>.  Bid and offer data from November 1, 2001 has been
> copied for the November 21st market trial.  Participants are encouraged to
> change the data as they wish, and will be able to view the results the
> following day.  Please remember the timeline for the market trials:
>
> *	At 8:00 a.m. on November 20th PJM will open the day-ahead market. During
> this time PJM Market Participants will submit generation offers, demand bids,
> increment offers, and decrement bids. The day-ahead market will remain open
> until 1200 on Tuesday, November 20th.
> *	At 1200 p.m. on Tuesday, November 20th the day-ahead market will close.
> *	By 1200 p.m. on Wednesday, November 21st PJM will post the results for
> the day-ahead market for November 21st.   The results will be posted at
> <https://emrkt2.pjm.com>, and historical hourly values will be available in .csv
> file format.
> Another market trial will take place on November 27th.
>
> You can find further information on PJM West and the PJM Market Trials at
> <http://www.pjm.com/custinfo/west/pjm_west.htm>.  If you have any questions
> please contact PJM at (610) 666-8980.
>
>
>
> Lynn Marie Horning
> Market Development Dept
> PJM Interconnection, L.L.C.
> horning@pjm.com <mailto:horning@pjm.com>
> Direct:	610-666-4714
> Fax:	610-666-4282
>

