http://www.multexinvestor.com/article.asp?docid=6041&nd=0119


2. INVESTMENT IDEAS
The new digital divide
Most Americans are now online, but they are still
divided by speed

By Ben Macklin, senior analyst, eMarketer

The famed FBI criminal profiling unit would have its work cut out if was
on the lookout for a criminal today whose only known characteristic was
that he is a regular US Internet user. With the widespread adoption of the
Internet in the US, the demographic characteristics of the average US
Internet user today so closely match those of the wider population that
there are very few distinguishing features between the two.

